<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT TASMANIA BY THREE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT TASMANIA BY THREE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>LAUNCESTON, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Tasmania by three wickets in their limited overs tour match at the Northern Tasmania Cricket Association Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores - Tasmania 235 for six in 50 overs (Shaun Young 59 not out); Pakistan 236 for seven in 49 overs (Zahoor Elahi 89).</p>
